 "text": "Hi, how are you doing? Best is a spot with a good view of the whole area, so you can set up and see everyone coming. That's a good spot. A taller tree or hill gives you a naturally raised stage, and people love being on it. You could clip it off halfway up. It adds a bit of height without making it look dead. Be careful with fire pit. A tent directly over it can lead to fire damage. That's the basic rule. You can always cross a branch off later if it starts looking too much.",
